  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>SnO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>C</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mtext>Sn</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>rxn</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>SnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>394</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>581</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>187</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KJ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi>rxn</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>Sn</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi>SnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>210</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>T&#916;S</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></math></p><p>For reaction to be spontaneous</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>T&#916;S</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>187</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>935</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
